OL,3,GNEWSASouth East Water appoints new
OL,4,Anon-executive chair
OL,5,
OL,6,FMorse said: "I look forward to working
OL,7,Fwith the team to accelerate progress,
OL,8,Fdeliver meaningful improvement, and
OL,9,Frebuild trust across our communities."
